  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, the hole of the socket is plated, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 1.25u vertical (1u wide x 1.25u tall, courtyard 19.00x23.76mm).")
